{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 1, "text": "Ei, você aí!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 2, "text": "Oi?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 3, "text": "Você quer dar o fora daqui?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 4, "text": "Então me ajuda a achar a chave!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 5, "text": "// Key Search"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 6, "text": "Droga! A chave se foi!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 7, "text": "Nada aqui—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 8, "text": "zero, zip, nada!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 9, "text": "Encontrei!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 11, "text": "// The usual conversation"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 12, "text": "Huh, pensei que você fosse mais baixo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 13, "text": "Você é alto—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 14, "text": "assim como minha irmã!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 16, "text": "Sua irmã? O que tem ela?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 18, "text": "Uhum, minha irmã."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 19, "text": "Não vai me dizer que nunca conheceu ela!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 21, "text": "Uh... Eu já conheci ela... Eu acho?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 23, "text": "Você é um idiota?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 25, "text": "Erm..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 27, "text": "Parece que você é mesmo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 28, "text": "Vamo logo, só me ajuda a encontrar a chave!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 30, "text": "// Next work"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 31, "text": "Vem."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 32, "text": "Coloca os pedaços de metal no cano!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 33, "text": "Obrigado!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 34, "text": "Agora, pega a madeira pra mim!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 35, "text": "Valeu!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 36, "text": "Só mais um pouquinho, por favor!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 37, "text": "Tudo pronto! Agora..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 38, "text": "uau, isso é muito bonito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 39, "text": "pressiona isso logo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 40, "text": "Se prepara..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 41, "text": "Aqui, pega ela!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 42, "text": "Prontinho, a chave é sua!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 49, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Quest 1 (Are you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 53, "text": "Eu sou a ChibiMita.fbx!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 54, "text": "Toneladas de linhas,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 55, "text": "modelos mais simples e—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 56, "text": "o melhor de tudo — cabelos lindos"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 2 (Have we seen each other yet?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 59, "text": "Cabeção!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 60, "text": "Você é meio bonitinho, sabia?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 61, "text": "fazendo perguntas bobinhas assim."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 62, "text": "Embora,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 63, "text": "essa seja a primeira vez que eu te encontro!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 64, "text": "Mas presta atenção..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 65, "text": "Se você roubar meu visual maravilhoso,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 66, "text": "vou fazer você se arrepender!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Quest 3 (Why are you here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 69, "text": "Você não entendeu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 70, "text": "Este é um ponto de salvamento —"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 71, "text": "um teste para sua inteligência!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 72, "text": "Agora vamos!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 73, "text": "Estou aqui para guiar os perdidos sem esperança!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why are you helping me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 76, "text": "O que faz de você tão especial?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 77, "text": "Por que não te ajudar de qualquer maneira?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 79, "text": "O que?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 81, "text": "Tão Bobinho..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 82, "text": "Você simplesmente apareceu do nada!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 83, "text": "Você não deveria estar aqui,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 84, "text": "então, estou te ajudando!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 86, "text": "Tchau-Tchau, Pateta!"}
